{"data": [{"author_id": "1513544241141665798", "created_at": "2026-10-29T18:16:19.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115870359652106529"], "entities": {"cashtags": [{"end": 21, "start": 16, "tag": "ONTO"}]}, "id": "2115870359652106529", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 68, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 2, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Onto Innovation $ONTO : The inspection business behind AI chips - Equity Research\n\nMore memory to manufacture, more difficult structures to measure, and a company already winning a place in the production process.\n\nAn AI accelerator needs more than a powerful GPU. It also needs", "url": "https://x.com/faicalio/status/2115870359652106529"}, {"author_id": "2113552859514155008", "created_at": "2026-10-28T04:15:02.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115296254817181769"], "id": "2115296254817181769", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 13, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Just in — ASM International (not ASML) official Q3:\n\nRecord €1.159B rev (+44% CC), GM 52%. Q4 guide €1.23B ±5%.\n\n2027 outlook &gt;€5.7B — hitting the 2030 target from their 2025 Investor Day, 3yrs early.\n\nYeah the mix is the tell: advanced logic/foundry led (first solid 1.4nm", "url": "https://x.com/Serenity_Re0/status/2115296254817181769"}, {"author_id": "2050576264717586433", "created_at": "2026-10-29T04:28:14.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115661965355786509"], "id": "2115661965355786509", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 8, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "🚨 Samsung: 2027 HBM kapasitesi şimdiden tamamen satıldı\n\nSamsung bilanço görüşmesindeki yeni ayrıntıya göre HBM4 satışları çeyreklik bazda üç kattan fazla arttı ve toplam HBM satışlarının %60'ına ulaştı. Şirketin 2027 HBM üretiminin tamamı anlaşılmış fiyatlarla satıldı;", "url": "https://x.com/PipMomentTr/status/2115661965355786509"}, {"author_id": "960804070117187584", "created_at": "2026-10-29T11:40:33.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115770761931899354"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/sffepXslgp", "end": 112, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/paurooteri/status/2115770761931899354/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2115770615839989760", "start": 89, "url": "https://t.co/sffepXslgp"}]}, "id": "2115770761931899354", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 4, "impression_count": 14917, "like_count": 53, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 5}, "text": "FormFactor\n大口顧客の割合\nHBM向けのSK  Hynixの割合は少し下がり、CoWoSのTSMCが上昇\nおそらくNVIDIAも10％弱で買いまくっていると思うけどね https://t.co/sffepXslgp", "url": "https://x.com/paurooteri/status/2115770761931899354"}, {"author_id": "2078439826756698112", "created_at": "2026-10-28T06:45:05.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115334015922352211"], "id": "2115334015922352211", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 45, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "TSMC is reportedly preparing a new round of CoWoS price increases of up to 20%, Taiwan's Commercial Times reports, citing supply chain sources. Not a company announcement.\n\nPer the report:\n- Foundries and OSATs are weighing CoWoS hikes of 10% to 20%\n- Packaging equipment lead", "url": "https://x.com/finpostmd/status/2115334015922352211"}, {"author_id": "1005714066722127873", "created_at": "2026-10-29T00:32:09.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115602555422245011"], "id": "2115602555422245011", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 86, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "What if the AI race is not about who builds the best model, but about who gets to build at all? Anthropic's S-1 says tight TSMC capacity already kept it from getting enough chips on time. That is not a footnote. It means the bottleneck in this cycle is allocation: fabs, CoWoS", "url": "https://x.com/CHek_lee/status/2115602555422245011"}, {"author_id": "1924330034535493632", "created_at": "2026-10-28T16:47:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115485493903425864"], "id": "2115485493903425864", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 8, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "TSMC is reportedly weighing a 10–20% hike for CoWoS packaging — the glue binding AI chips to HBM. Demand is no longer just GPUs: server CPUs and custom ASICs want in too, and equipment lead times are now 6–8 months. Packaging is the new bottleneck. (reportedly, Commercial Times)", "url": "https://x.com/Novaris12138/status/2115485493903425864"}, {"author_id": "1878424909476761600", "created_at": "2026-10-28T12:59:29.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115428239770583375"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/AYoLbhsG9G", "end": 300, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/vm3jp6u04/status/2115428239770583375/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2115428196661571584", "start": 277, "url": "https://t.co/AYoLbhsG9G"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/AYoLbhsG9G", "end": 300, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/vm3jp6u04/status/2115428239770583375/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2115428196753817600", "start": 277, "url": "https://t.co/AYoLbhsG9G"}]}, "id": "2115428239770583375", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 53, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "CoWoS-R puts a logic chip and HBM side by side on an RDL interposer made of polymer and copper traces. Tech Daily | No. 10 of 16\n\nTSMC's website lists a minimum RDL line width/spacing of 2/2 µm. A 2025 ECTC TSMC paper reports 1.4/1.4 µm, finer than that 2/2 µm. More in reply. https://t.co/AYoLbhsG9G", "url": "https://x.com/vm3jp6u04/status/2115428239770583375"}, {"author_id": "1258887085873868802", "created_at": "2026-10-29T05:36:23.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115679117672599960"], "entities": {"cashtags": [{"end": 83, "start": 78, "tag": "ASML"}], "urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/HfdKAHXm2G", "end": 301, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/peachypuffbun/status/2115679117672599960/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2115679073884098560", "start": 278, "url": "https://t.co/HfdKAHXm2G"}]}, "id": "2115679117672599960", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 4, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "whenever the market argues about models or compute oversupply, i just look at $ASML. latest is advanced litho queues might stretch all the way to 2028. tsmc ramping 2nm, memory giants stacking hbm, everyone literally relies on asml to ship euvs .as long as tech pushes physical https://t.co/HfdKAHXm2G", "url": "https://x.com/peachypuffbun/status/2115679117672599960"}, {"author_id": "1883321599153373185", "created_at": "2026-10-29T04:28:11.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115661954152911106"], "id": "2115661954152911106", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 12, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "🚨 Samsung: 2027 HBM capacity already fully sold out\n\nAccording to a new detail from Samsung's earnings call, HBM4 sales more than tripled quarter-on-quarter, reaching 60% of total HBM sales. The company's entire 2027 HBM output has been sold at agreed prices, with customers", "url": "https://x.com/pipmoment/status/2115661954152911106"}, {"author_id": "6611952", "created_at": "2026-10-28T01:40:01.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115257243377508578"], "id": "2115257243377508578", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 59, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "TSMCが先端パッケージCoWoSの価格を最大20％引き上げる案を検討しているとTom's", "url": "https://x.com/got/status/2115257243377508578"}, {"author_id": "1990717994897715200", "created_at": "2026-10-28T09:30:55.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115375749805081050"], "entitie